{"name":"Magenta Manicure","hex":"#983166","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"magenta","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color which is close to the equal mixture of red and blue which is an additive secondary color but a subtractive primary color evoked by the combination of red and light blue."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having the color of fuchsia, fuchsine, light purple."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/magenta"},{"term":"manicure","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A cosmetic treatment for the fingernails.","A manicurist."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To apply such a treatment to the hands.","To polish or trim something very finely or evenly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/manicure"}],"entries":[{"title":"Manicure","blocks":[{"text":"A manicure is a mostly cosmetic beauty treatment for the fingernails and hands performed at home or in a nail salon. A manicure usually consists of filing and shaping the free edge of nails, pushing and clipping any nonliving tissue at the cuticle and removing hangnails, treatments with various liquids, massage of the hand, and the application of fingernail polish. When the same is applied to the toenails and feet, the treatment is referred to as a pedicure. Together, the treatments may be known as a mani-pedi."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Hastings_County_Archives_OSD_1938-1939-54_%2839912414015%29.jpg/330px-Hastings_County_Archives_OSD_1938-1939-54_%2839912414015%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manicure","wikidata":"Q747493"},{"title":"Magenta","blocks":[{"text":"Magenta is a purplish-pink color. On color wheels of the RGB and CMYK color models, it is located directly midway between blue and red. It is one of the four colors of subtractive ink used in color printing by most color printers, also known as CMYK along with yellow, cyan, and black to make all the other colors and hues. The tone of magenta used in printing, printer's magenta, is redder than the magenta of the RGB (additive) model, the former being closer to rose."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Pink_swanboat_hosting_a_real_bird_on_its_head%2C_on_Shinobazu_Pond%2C_Ueno_Park%2C_Tokyo.jpg/330px-Pink_swanboat_hosting_a_real_bird_on_its_head%2C_on_Shinobazu_Pond%2C_Ueno_Park%2C_Tokyo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magenta","wikidata":"Q3276756"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Manicure_closeup.jpg/330px-Manicure_closeup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Manicure_closeup.jpg/330px-Manicure_closeup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Manicure closeup –clear nail polish being applied","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AManicure_closeup.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Acrylic_nail_art_with_crystal.jpg/500px-Acrylic_nail_art_with_crystal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Acrylic_nail_art_with_crystal.jpg/1280px-Acrylic_nail_art_with_crystal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Acrylic_nail_art_with_crystal.jpg/500px-Acrylic_nail_art_with_crystal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Acrylic manicure with jewel design","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAcrylic_nail_art_with_crystal.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Nail_cleaner_%28FindID_792020%29.jpg/500px-Nail_clean